WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Treasure Island

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.630
Billy Bones was the first mate...

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:09.180
...and Flint was the captain.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.650
There were also men like Blind Pew...

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.710
...and Black Dog—a real bunch of daredevils.

00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:18.660
And guess what? Our leader today
is none other than their helmsman.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:29.390
<i>I-I didn't want to believe it.
Silver was...!</i>

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.830
<i>My friend, John Silver...</i>

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.380
<i>He was the cursed one-legged man that Billy Bones feared!</i>

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.480
Island in sight!

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.440
It's Treasure Island!

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.070
<i>Treasure Island?</i>

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:15.990
Treasure
Island

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:15.790
Takarajima

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:24.600
saa ikou

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:24.600
Come, let's go

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.690
yume ni mita shima heto

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.690
To the island that I've dreamed of

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.530
nami wo koete kaze ni notte

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:31.530
Across the waves, on the wind

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.410
umi hedeyou

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.410
We'll travel the oceans

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.330
ikute ni wa

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:37.330
Many of us

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.330
minna mada shiranai

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:40.330
Still don't know of

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:44.080
fushigi na hiru to yoru toga

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:44.080
The days and nights full of mystery

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.580
matte iru darou

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.580
That await us there

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.090
itsumo shinji you

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.090
We must always have trust

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.340
magokoro wo

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:53.340
And be sincere

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:59.600
yuuki wo mune ni susumou yo

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:59.600
And have courage in our hearts to move forward

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.730
tade hitotsu no

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.730
I only...

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.150
akogare dake wa

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.150
...have one desire

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.440
doko no dare ni mo

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.440
And no one...

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:15.150
kese wa shinai sa

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:15.150
...will ever take it away

